sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Approver / Admin
    participant Auth as Session Auth
    participant Controller as ApprovalsController
    participant Service as ApprovalService
    participant Contract as IInvoiceRepository
    participant Store as InMemoryRepository

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        Caller->>Auth: POST approve invoice
        Auth->>Controller: Continue after session authentication
        Note over Controller: RequireRole Approver or Admin
    end

    rect rgb(236, 253, 245)
        Controller->>Service: Approve invoice using session username
        Service->>Contract: GetById invoice
        Contract->>Store: GetById invoice
        Store-->>Contract: Invoice or null
        Contract-->>Service: Invoice or null

        alt Invoice not found
            Service-->>Controller: KeyNotFoundException
        else Invoice found and pending
            Service->>Service: EnsurePending
            Service->>Service: Set Approved, DecidedBy and UTC timestamp
            Service->>Contract: Update invoice
            Contract->>Store: Update invoice
            Store-->>Contract: Updated in-memory item
            Contract-->>Service: Return
            Service-->>Controller: Updated invoice
        end
    end

    Controller-->>Caller: Return HTTP response

    Note over Caller,Store: AS-BUILT. In-memory state only. No durable database or PayEx submission.

    %% Evidence: route, role and session username: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Controllers/ApprovalsController.cs.
    %% Middleware registration: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/Program.cs.
    %% Lookup, pending-state guard, decision fields and update: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Domain/ApprovalService.cs.
    %% Concrete lookup/update: backend/src/InvoiceApp.Api/InMemoryInvoiceRepository.cs.
    %% Error mapping convention: AGENTS.md and ApiControllerBase.
